  "description": "The native payload for Agora's AV1 video encoder extension, staged out of the AgoraRtcEngine_macOS 4.6.2 archive and packaged for .NET for macOS. AV1 encoding, for the bandwidth saving over H.264 where both ends support it. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Mac or Net.Agora.Voice.Mac — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is AgoraVideoEncoderConfiguration with an AV1 codec type in the RTC binding.",
